          "text": "Aletheia Capital estimates that PCB content per Google  $GOOGL  TPU v8 rack could reach $30,000 to $40,000, up from about $20,000 for TPU v7. Its estimate assumes eight compute trays per v8 rack, each with four TPUs.  The firm expects CCL content per rack to rise to between $12,000",
